{"title":"推进告知承诺制审批和信用监管","date":"2024-05-31","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">推进告知承诺制审批和信用监管</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋;\">广州市工程建设项目审批制度改革试点工作领导小组办公室关于推进告知承诺制审批和信用监管的通知</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">各有关部门、各单位：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">为贯彻落实《国务院关于开展营商环境创新试点工作的意见》（国发〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2021</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">24</span>号）、《国务院办公厅关于全面开展工程建设项目审批制度改革的实施意见》（国办发〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2019</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">11</span>号）以及广州市《关于支持改革创新宽容失误的意见》等相关要求，创新探索我市告知承诺制审批与监管服务方式，结合前期试行情况，现就有关工作通知如下：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">一、持续推进告知承诺制审批</span></b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">（一）对通过事中事后监管能够纠正不符合审批条件的行为且不会产生严重后果的工程建设项目审批事项，实行告知承诺制。申请人按照要求作出书面承诺的，审批部门可以根据申请人信用等情况直接作出审批决定。对已经实施区域评估范围内的工程建设项目，相应的审批事项实行告知承诺制。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">（二）告知承诺制审批可分为容缺型和告知型，由审批部门自行确定。容缺型是指申请人以提交承诺书等方式替代部分申报材料或要求，申请人需要在审批部门确定的承诺期限内，向审批部门补充提交容缺材料，经审批部门确认后完成承诺事项的闭合。告知型是指申请人以提交承诺书等方式承诺符合审批条件或履行相应职责，审批部门不设定承诺期限，申请人也无需补充提交材料，相关部门后续依法开展事中事后检查。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">（三）各审批部门应当通过政策文件、办事指南等方式向社会公开实行告知承诺制审批的工程建设项目审批事项，结合本部门实际，明确具体要求、承诺类型、承诺期限、企业不履行承诺的处理方式、承诺书格式文本等内容。市工程建设项目审批制度改革试点工作领导小组办公室负责汇总发布全市工程建设项目告知承诺制审批事项清单。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">二、加强承诺制事项的事中事后监管</span></b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">定时间内对承诺人履行承诺的情况进行检查，承诺人未履行承诺的，审批部门要根据情节严重程度、可能产生的后果风险等因素综合研判，采取网站通报、信用公示、停工整改直至依法撤销行政审批决定并追究承诺人的相应责任。各审批部门要形成合力，在承诺事项未履行完成前，暂停相关企业再次以承诺制方式申报审批的资格（不影响企业以正常途径申报审批事项），共同构建&ldquo;一处失信、处处受限&rdquo;的诚信环境。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">三、信用公示途径</span></b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:\r\nwindowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">公示栏目。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&ldquo;信用广州&rdquo;网站&mdash;&mdash;&ldquo;信用公示&rdquo;&mdash;&mdash;&ldquo;工程建设审批查询&rdquo;&mdash;&mdash;&ldquo;不履行承诺信息&rdquo;栏目。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:\r\nwindowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">公示方式</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）容缺型：</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">申请人未在承诺期限内补充提交有关材料，未完成承诺事项闭合的，审批部门应及时提醒告知，确定逾期后将企业不履行承诺的信息推送至&ldquo;信用广州&rdquo;公示。鼓励各审批部门通过系统自动对接方式，自动推送至&ldquo;信用广州&rdquo;公示。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）告知型：</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">市、区各相关行政主管部门在日常监督检查中发现企业提供资料造假、不按规定履行告知承诺行为的（如规划条件核实、环评审批、企业资质、预售许可、城市基础设施配套费缴交、装配式建设、绿色建筑、地下管线等相关业务），及时将相关单位不履行承诺的信息推送至&ldquo;信用广州&rdquo;公示。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">公示期限</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">根据《广州市工程项目审批告知承诺制试行方案》<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>穗建改〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2018</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>号）》，不履行承诺信息在&ldquo;信用广州&rdquo;的公示期限为<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>个月。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">四、承诺制延期申请</span></b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">申请人如因政府部门发布新要求、政策变动等客观特殊原因，确实无法在承诺期限内补充提交容缺材料的，应及时向审批部门提交情况说明申请延期，经审批部门同意后，可予以延期一至两次。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">五、信用公示救济方式</span></b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">如对&ldquo;信用广州&rdquo;网站&mdash;&mdash;&ldquo;不履行承诺信息&rdquo;公示的信息存在异议的，企业可向审批部门进行反馈，由审批部门核实后，对系统推送异常错漏情况予以调整。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">六、信用修复</span></b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">为鼓励企业守约履诺，优化我市营商环境，经审批部门确认承诺事项已履行完成的，相关不诚信公示信息，可按程序修复撤下。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">本通知印发实施之日起，《广州市工程建设项目审批制度改革试点工作领导小组办公室关于<span lang=\"EN-US\">&lt;</span>关于加强承诺制审批事项事中事后监管与信用公示的通知（试行）<span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;</span>续期的通知》（穗建改〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>号）同步废止。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">特此通知。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<br style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\" />\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:\r\nwindowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<br />\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:\r\nwindowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><!--[endif]--></span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">附件：</span><a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202405/%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%BE%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA%E5%88%B6%E5%AE%A1%E6%89%B9%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E6%B8%85%E5%8D%95.doc\"><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; font-size: 15pt; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">广州工程建设项目承诺制审批事项清单</span></a></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: right; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: right; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: right; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<br style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\" />\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-bidi;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nZH-CN;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">广州市工程建设项目审批制度改革试点工作领导小组办公室</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: right; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">　　<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">23</span>日</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}